{
    "title": "Bitget Wallet: Crypto and BTC",
    "description": "Bitget Wallet is one of the world's largest non-custodial Web3 multi-chain crypto wallets. Since its establishment in 2018, it has grown to support over 250,000 cryptocurrencies and 20,000 DApps across more than 100 mainnets.\r\n\r\n100+ mainnets: Bitcoin, Ethereum, BNB Chain, Solana, Ripple, Polkadot, Avalanche, Dogecoin, Cosmos, TRON, Ethereum Classic, Filecoin, EOS, Klaytn, IOST, Terra, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Linea, zkSync Era, StarkNet, Gnosis Chain, Metis, Aptos, Mantle, Heco, Harmony, Fantom, Celo, Merlin Chain, Blast, Degen Chain, ZETA Chain, and most recently, The Open Network (TON).\r\n\r\n250,000+ cryptocurrencies: \r\nBTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOT, AVAX, DOGE, ATOM, TRX, ETC, FIL, EOS, KLAY, IOST, LUNA, MATIC, ARB, OP, APT, MNT, GNO, METIS, HECO, ONE, FTM, CELO, USDT, USDC, SHIB, DAI, NEAR, ICP, UNI, XMR, IMX, WLD, and many more, including token standards such as ERC20, ERC721, ERC1155, TRC20, and BRC20.\r\n\r\nWith Bitget Wallet, you can create a wallet for any cryptocurrency you choose, including SOL, ETH, BTC, MPC, DOGE, USDT, SHIB, BRC20, TON, and many more!\r\nBitget Wallet: Decentralized assets at your fingertips\r\nBitget Wallet offers a comprehensive suite of on-chain products, including DeFi, DApps, swaps, and metaverse services, delivering a seamless blockchain experience with advanced asset management capabilities.\r\n\r\n\u2013 One of the fastest growing Web3 wallets\r\nBitget Wallet is a leading name in crypto asset management. As one of the fastest-growing wallets in the Web3 space, it now serves over 40 million users worldwide. By connecting users to more than 100 major blockchains, Bitget Wallet functions as a top DEX aggregator, providing access to the best prices from decentralized exchanges. It also facilitates exploration of a diverse range of premium cryptocurrencies and digital assets.\r\n\r\n\u2013 The hottest airdrop farming opportunities\r\nBitget Wallet offers a variety of airdrop opportunities, including Fairlaunchpool, Launchpad, GetDrop, and Task2Get, ensuring you're among the first to receive the tokens you want. With its cutting-edge, user-friendly interface, the wallet simplifies navigation and interaction within the blockchain ecosystem.\r\n\r\n\u2013 Enhanced security and user-friendly features\r\nBitget Wallet ensures top-notch security with multiple layers, including biometric authentication and hardware wallet compatibility. It enhances transaction safety through smart contract functionality and transaction verification. Additionally, the crypto wallet alerts users to potential risks with unsafe addresses, contributing to a secure and user-friendly crypto experience.\r\n\r\n\u2013 Web3 social integration\r\nBitget Wallet integrates Web3 social features by allowing users to set ENS domain names for their crypto wallets. This functionality personalizes their Web3 identity and enhances social interactions on the blockchain.\r\n\r\nFor more information, visit:\r\nWebsite: https://web3.bitget.com\r\nX: https://twitter.com/BitgetWallet\r\nDiscord: https://discord.com/invite/qjH6YGDYgh\r\nTelegram: https://t.me/Bitget_Wallet_Announcement\r\n\r\nBitget Wallet: Your Web3 trading wallet of the future.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bitget Wallet is one of the world&#39;s largest non-custodial Web3 multi-chain crypto wallets. Since its establishment in 2018, it has grown to support over 250,000 cryptocurrencies and 20,000 DApps across more than 100 mainnets.<br><br>100+ mainnets: Bitcoin, Ethereum, BNB Chain, Solana, Ripple, Polkadot, Avalanche, Dogecoin, Cosmos, TRON, Ethereum Classic, Filecoin, EOS, Klaytn, IOST, Terra, Polygon, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Linea, zkSync Era, StarkNet, Gnosis Chain, Metis, Aptos, Mantle, Heco, Harmony, Fantom, Celo, Merlin Chain, Blast, Degen Chain, ZETA Chain, and most recently, The Open Network (TON).<br><br>250,000+ cryptocurrencies: <br>BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, DOT, AVAX, DOGE, ATOM, TRX, ETC, FIL, EOS, KLAY, IOST, LUNA, MATIC, ARB, OP, APT, MNT, GNO, METIS, HECO, ONE, FTM, CELO, USDT, USDC, SHIB, DAI, NEAR, ICP, UNI, XMR, IMX, WLD, and many more, including token standards such as ERC20, ERC721, ERC1155, TRC20, and BRC20.<br><br>With Bitget Wallet, you can create a wallet for any cryptocurrency you choose, including SOL, ETH, BTC, MPC, DOGE, USDT, SHIB, BRC20, TON, and many more!<br>Bitget Wallet: Decentralized assets at your fingertips<br>Bitget Wallet offers a comprehensive suite of on-chain products, including DeFi, DApps, swaps, and metaverse services, delivering a seamless blockchain experience with advanced asset management capabilities.<br><br>\u2013 One of the fastest growing Web3 wallets<br>Bitget Wallet is a leading name in crypto asset management. As one of the fastest-growing wallets in the Web3 space, it now serves over 40 million users worldwide. By connecting users to more than 100 major blockchains, Bitget Wallet functions as a top DEX aggregator, providing access to the best prices from decentralized exchanges. It also facilitates exploration of a diverse range of premium cryptocurrencies and digital assets.<br><br>\u2013 The hottest airdrop farming opportunities<br>Bitget Wallet offers a variety of airdrop opportunities, including Fairlaunchpool, Launchpad, GetDrop, and Task2Get, ensuring you&#39;re among the first to receive the tokens you want. With its cutting-edge, user-friendly interface, the wallet simplifies navigation and interaction within the blockchain ecosystem.<br><br>\u2013 Enhanced security and user-friendly features<br>Bitget Wallet ensures top-notch security with multiple layers, including biometric authentication and hardware wallet compatibility. It enhances transaction safety through smart contract functionality and transaction verification. Additionally, the crypto wallet alerts users to potential risks with unsafe addresses, contributing to a secure and user-friendly crypto experience.<br><br>\u2013 Web3 social integration<br>Bitget Wallet integrates Web3 social features by allowing users to set ENS domain names for their crypto wallets. This functionality personalizes their Web3 identity and enhances social interactions on the blockchain.<br><br>For more information, visit:<br>Website: https://web3.bitget.com<br>X: https://twitter.com/BitgetWallet<br>Discord: https://discord.com/invite/qjH6YGDYgh<br>Telegram: https://t.me/Bitget_Wallet_Announcement<br><br>Bitget Wallet: Your Web3 trading wallet of the future.",
